<title>USA: Salt Lake Cty, Utah, won by Zions First Natl Bank.</title>
<headline>Salt Lake Cty, Utah, won by Zions First Natl Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions First National Bank said it won $13 million of Salt Lake County, Utah, general obligation criminal justice bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.2688 percent.</p>
</text>
